WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.083
The product totals CTE creates one row per
department and product The

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:12.855
ranked CTE keeps the same grain but adds DENSE_RANK
within each department The

00:00:12.882 --> 00:00:18.631
final SELECT filters to the top two rank groups Run
the query and trace

00:00:18.658 --> 00:00:24.456
the grain through all three stages This is a strong
example of readable

00:00:24.483 --> 00:00:25.509
advanced SQL
